"""
==============================================================================
Woolf Systems & Quant Engine — Terminal Study CLI (woolf)
==============================================================================
Usage:
  woolf                             Show daily status & 3-problem mission deck
  woolf solve <1|2|3>               1-click solve a mission slot
  woolf solve "Title" [Diff] [Cat]  Log any custom solved problem
  woolf fail <1|2|3> "Why missed"   Log a failure to spaced repetition bank
  woolf patterns                    Show ASCII mastery bars across all 18 patterns
  woolf search <query>              Search 327 curated NeetCode & Google problems
  woolf history                     View recent submissions
